b. This Hon'ble Court by way of its appropriate writ, order or direction may kindly be pleased to quash land acquisition proceedings initiated under Maharashtra Industrial Development Act with respect to Survey no. 150, Hissa no.3 situated at village Mann,
Taluka Mulshi, District Solapur;
c.

